<item><title>每天10小时烧脑14天：调色学习的终极打开方式</title><description><![CDATA[<div id="user-content-media">

                
                    <img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/eMc0IA2vcnPlU0uEIjUHUXEbtgpbqx2EJruhuV9oBgiadMVpZ9BJUtHYNqm1Q75Ff6icm60Vl2y24ibCUC7WupJhFfHWhr4jRib9zCwlZI29ib7o/0?wx_fmt=jpeg?imageView2/1/w/600">
                
            </div>
        
    

    
    
        <div id="user-content-js_content"><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">去年开始，我们把十年的经验拓展，推出了全新的“14天达芬奇调色实战训练营”，仅在每年暑期和春节开放。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">来自全国各地的朋友们，年龄、身份迥异：有初出茅庐的大学生，有工作多年的职场中坚力量，也有并不以影视为职业，却因为单纯的热爱而走进教室的影像爱好者。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">在同一个空间里，他们共同完成了一场高强度、为期十四天的调色之旅。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: center;"><b><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, ">一场和色彩互动的“浸入式学习”</span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><b><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">如果你没有亲临现场，可能无法想象它的密度与张力。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">每天十个小时以上的专注学习，意味着整个大脑处于全速运转的状态。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">操作软件只是开端——我们从最基础的工具讲起，再到色彩科学，逐步进入不同类型作品的实战模拟：从短剧到纪录片，再到TVC广告、宣传片。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">在这样高频率的输入和操练下，大家时常在两种状态中切换：一面是“直呼过瘾”的兴奋，另一面是恳求老师“能不能讲慢点”的焦灼。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><section style="text-align: center;"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/m8KNGkr0JrFe7HAQcuvAw9aXxTRhPCWniaBFT40854lhkdoJfNicgCMsruUHNgvFKPLSB1Ismjric7o2JbkN4kZ0w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&#x26;from=appmsg#imgIndex=0"></section><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">这是线下调色教学的独特魅力所在。</span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">不单纯是技术堆叠，更像是一种身体性的学习过程</span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">：眼睛在练习，手在练习，感知色彩的大脑神经也在飞速的运转。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: center;"><b><span style="font-weight: bold;line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, ">从工具到“观察”</span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><b><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">初学者常常以为，掌握一款软件的快捷键，学会几个预设，便能完成所谓的“调色”。然而在训练营没几天，许多学员就意识到，这种理解过于简单。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">色彩的学习，真正的难处在于如何“看”。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">所谓“看”，并不仅仅是用肉眼去分辨一张画面偏绿还是偏蓝，而是要学会在画面中识别结构：光影的方向、肤色的微妙变化、叙事节奏与色彩之间的张力。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">这就像去学习一种新的语言，十四天里，大家不断被提醒：软件是工具，而观察才是核心。</span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">在这里不是教你依赖某种“公式”，而是帮你打磨感官</span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">：一种能在不同画面情境下做出判断、在无数种可能性中找到最合适方案的直觉。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/m8KNGkr0JrFe7HAQcuvAw9aXxTRhPCWnax9xfKKPWtrA3Oz9Qo9quos1aT8QUkicZMaibicNEKNYA5FLKlbO9sLCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&#x26;from=appmsg#imgIndex=1"></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">每天超过十小时的学习，意味着一种“战壕效应”。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">当你和一群陌生的同学被放进同一间教室，共同面对大量信息的冲击，疲惫、困惑与突破，都会被放大。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">大家在第二周都不同程度的经历了一点心理低谷。那几天的课堂上，白板上的流程图解、软件界面的节点，仿佛永远学不完。正是在这个时刻，大家开始彼此鼓励：有人会在课间耐心为同伴复盘步骤，有人会把自己一天的笔记分享出来。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">十四天结束时，很多人说，自己收获的并不仅仅是技能，还有一群共同进步的朋友。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">这种关系的价值，或许会在未来不断显现：当他们走向不同的项目和工作环境，这种共享过学习压力的记忆，会成为一种难得的纽带。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: center;"><b><span style="font-weight: bold;line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, ">为什么选择“线下”</span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: center;"><b><span style="font-weight: bold;line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">在今天，几乎所有知识都能在互联网上找到。随时打开一个视频网站，免费 DaVinci Resolve 教程几乎是取之不竭的。那么，为什么还要专门走进一个线下课堂，花上十四天时间？</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">“沉浸”可能是其中的原因之一。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">互联网的学习无疑是零散的、片段化的。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">你可能在一周里学会某个功能，却无法真正把它放进整全的认知体系中。而线下训练营的意义，是把学员完全抽离出日常，放进一个“全封闭”的空间。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">在这里，你不能逃避，你必须专注。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">当一个人每天十小时以上地面对同一个问题时，他的思维方式会被迫改变。这种转变无法通过碎片化学习实现。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><b><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">在课堂的最后几天，我们也收到了大家公开和私下分享的心得。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;">“我之前以为调色是行业高手才配做的事，但这十四天让我觉得，原来我也开始能看懂光，看懂色了。”</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;">“以前我剪辑完成后，只能是把调色交给别人做，接下来我终于可以亲自上手了，因为色彩也是叙事的一部分。”</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">训练营结束的那一刻，教室里响起了掌声。有人拍照留念，有人依依不舍。但更重要的，是每个人带走了一种新的能力——不再只是观看，而是开始学会如何“看见”。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">看见色彩背后的逻辑。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">看见叙事与画面之间的张力。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">看见自己原来可以走到这样远。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><section style="text-align: center;"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/m8KNGkr0JrFe7HAQcuvAw9aXxTRhPCWnk857ac5bLR6wP1XLtbqHyGvnnGv39bZGicvXOPZjLN4ON0afRicxt5bw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&#x26;from=appmsg#imgIndex=2"></section><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">这种看见，会在未来的日子里不断延伸：在每一部作品、每一次拍摄、每一段调色创作中，成为一种持续的力量。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">如果你愿意，你也能加入这样的旅程。</span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: center;"><b><span dir="LTR"><span style="font-weight: bold;line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></span></b></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">我们开启</span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">了</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">26年暑期</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">的</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">报名</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: bold;">通道。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="font-weight: bold;">地点：</span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">北京</span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">/</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">成都两地开课</span></span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="font-weight: bold;">时间：</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: normal;">26</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: normal;">年7</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);font-weight: normal;">月-8月</span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">（提前预定）</span></span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="font-weight: bold;">费用：</span></span></span></span><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><span><span style="color: rgb(60, 59, 59);">18800</span><span style="color: rgb(41, 41, 41);font-weight: normal;">（含14天住宿）</span></span></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;"><span dir="LTR"><span style="line-height: 1.6em;color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family: mp-quote, "><br></span></span></p><section style="text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0.5em;"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="width: 211px; height: 211px; box-shadow: rgb(240, 240, 240) 0px 0px 0.5em 0px; background-color: transparent; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/eMc0IA2vcnPCzYdUSDxx47l0Wr1ouRLoqSuXmynGLCPHCycfvwlp5CJnJm8TdDc3oZ0iczo1iajwjnOHyeqXmcOorACqfhtp3X0DWAykFpUog/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&#x26;from=appmsg"></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;"><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);font-family